      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_01",
      "speaker": "miku",
      "text": "サクッと……まあ、そういうこと。 足りない分はバイト代の貯金と他のイベントで稼ぐつもり",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_8_01/adv_voice_eventstory_8_01_073.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_01/adv_script_eventstory_8_01-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_01-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "96c8bacdbeb09fada991fa8183b64719bdee3158201fb13a5c1510e2a3f9b4db",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_01_073.wav",
      "subtitle": "轻松……算了，就是这么回事。\n不够的部分，我打算靠打工攒下的钱和参加其他活动来凑齐",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "9cbc3a87129d2cbc09d2ba7a4f1dc384774d9f5b2107134bc62f9e1b0cd58fd6",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_01/adv_script_eventstory_8_01-Text/adv_script_eventstory_8_01-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_02_050",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_02",
      "speaker": "miku",
      "text": "……なんでもいいけど、洗濯物優先だからね。 今日は２回まわさなきゃいけないから",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_8_02/adv_voice_eventstory_8_02_050.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_02/adv_script_eventstory_8_02-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_02-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "cb5ead96b7d4bf37c0e1455721f987700798758b8dffd342fdb3c6390ad4a458",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_02_050.wav",
      "subtitle": "……怎样都好，不过得优先处理衣服哦。\n今天得洗两轮才行",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "38a82f8b88524f9e6b6666c0d53a4db0efa635cdfcb7cacf4e95192152e493bb",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_02/adv_script_eventstory_8_02-Text/adv_script_eventstory_8_02-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_093",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_06",
      "speaker": "miku",
      "text": "寧月はそれを繰り返すうちに 自分の気持ちが見えにくくなっちゃったんじゃないかな",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_8_06/adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_093.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_06/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "ece351365b8c62e7e726462019ceafa0c023481d0b906a125ae13f440ade2445",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_093.wav",
      "subtitle": "宁月可能就是在一次次做出这种选择的过程中，\n渐渐看不清自己内心真正的想法了吧",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "2faa410512ab4a35cfe223895fcc255818ed55c8a352c39cc8f43a7dedc55313",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_06/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Text/adv_script_eventstory_8_06-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_07_088",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_07",
      "speaker": "miku",
      "text": "こうなったのはあんたのせいだからね！ 出来もしないことをできるって言わないで",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_8_07/adv_voice_eventstory_8_07_088.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_07/adv_script_eventstory_8_07-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_07-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "7bc57017fb66ca05c5c50abfa00114504007f0d71db45013489c7f7451fc1317",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_07_088.wav",
      "subtitle": "会搞成这样都是你的错！\n别把做不到的事说得好像做得到一样",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "52e32c653bd1f5e407b622687681e5c65e000cec4156066bbc595d6a6ec54cef",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_07/adv_script_eventstory_8_07-Text/adv_script_eventstory_8_07-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_040",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10096",
      "speaker": "miku",
      "text": "はい。わたしがアイドルのスカウトを受ける代わりに ライブハウスのことは諦めてほしいんです",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_040.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "33c544dd0bff30e07740173b370ddc23a7cb5830b2f0f48d11b69c941801cf14",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_040.wav",
      "subtitle": "对。要我答应参加偶像选拔的话，\n我希望你们能放弃那家Live House",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "440529ad091fe3afe838d2f3de974637a09064a344e5cba29852dde7d6fe5af0",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_043",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10096",
      "speaker": "miku",
      "text": "でも……わたしという『人材を見つけた鈴木さんの 評価は鰻上り』になるチャンス、逃していいんですか？",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_043.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "38ca809332302bf32502a02b855670cd0e251fea2eb4774e45ca56babb50f6cb",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_043.wav",
      "subtitle": "不过……你这双发现人才的慧眼，\n可是能让铃木小姐你口碑飙升的好机会，你打算错过吗？",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "43e45f2dd16a5ff8e02a4647d6fd9c8aa67c3148bf6f8087c28ff66de039264b",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
