      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_07",
      "speaker": "miku",
      "text": "蕾叶、魚捌ける知り合いに連絡！ ご近所ネットワークでもなんでも使って！",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_8_07/adv_voice_eventstory_8_07_089.m4a",
